# Draft PRs = no checks

| State | Actions | Vercel |
|-------|---------|--------|
| **draft** | Skipped (`ci.yml` `if`) | No feature-branch deploy; belt `scripts/vercel-ignore-draft-pr.sh` |
| **ready** | lint/typecheck | Still no feature-branch deploy — preview = `development` / local |
| push `development` | Runs | Preview on prod project (SSO) + `rocha-cotizador-dev` public |
| push `main` | Runs | Auto-deploy off; Actions ships prod |

## Agent

- Always `gh pr create --draft` unless user says otherwise in that message
- Never `gh pr ready` / undraft unless user ordered it
- Draft: do not wait on `gh pr checks` (skipped on purpose)
- No branch-only `deploymentEnabled` hacks

## Vercel token

Preview needs `GITHUB_TOKEN`/`GH_TOKEN` (`repo` / `pull_requests: read`) or ignore script fails closed.

Refs: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, `scripts/vercel-ignore-draft-pr.sh`, `docs/ci.md`
